+---
+id: task-003-discount-rentals-of-three-days
+type: task
+title: "Discount rentals of three days"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Apply a 10% discount to the full price of every rental lasting three or more complete UTC days.
+
+## Acceptance criteria
+
+- Quotes for rentals of three or more days return the discounted total in euro cents.
+- Confirmed bookings show the same discounted total as their quote.
+- Rentals shorter than three days retain their full price.
